sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Comerciante
  participant Web as Frontend
  participant API as Express API
  participant Sale as sale.service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>Web: Agregar items + confirmar
  Note over Web: soldAt omitido = ahora servidor ART
  Web->>API: POST /api/sales localId items
  API->>Sale: createSale
  Sale->>DB: load products active del local
  Sale->>Sale: snapshot unit_sale_price + unit_cost
  Sale->>DB: tx INSERT sales + sale_lines
  Note over DB: sold_at timestamptz
  DB-->>Sale: sale id
  Sale-->>API: sale dto
  API-->>Web: 201 Created
  Web->>Web: invalidateQueries sales
  Web-->>U: Toast Venta registrada
  Note over Web: Resumen Hoy usa dia calendario ART
